**2 strategies fixed, 8 passed clean.**

Both fixes were the same class of bug: `session_start`/`session_end` were declared on the strategy but the `compute()` method never applied a session-window filter to the entry signals. Entries were firing outside market hours. The fix added `time_ok = (time_mins >= self.session_start) & (time_mins <= self.session_end)` and applied it to both `long_entry` and `short_entry`.
